{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Amazon 為 Apple Watch Series 12 (GPS) 帶來網購優惠，42mm 鋁金屬型號由原價 US$399 減至 US$299，減幅 25%。46mm 鋁金屬現價 US$349，原價 US$449，減幅 22%。若正考慮升級手上的 Apple Watch，現在正是比較尺寸與預算、趁優惠入手的好時機。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"Anything 2\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"536\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Anything-2-1024x536.webp\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<h2>Apple Watch Series 12 (GPS) 重點功能</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>心率與恢復參考</strong>：升級心率感應可每 5 分鐘量度 HRV，配合壓力與恢復狀況提供參考；新增 readiness 狀態評估，分析近期活動與生命徵象，提示當日適宜休息或加操。</li>\n<li><strong>Vitals 睡眠整合</strong>：Vitals app 整合睡眠期間健康數據，並提供每日睡眠分數與經期追蹤，讓用戶更容易掌握休息質素及身體週期變化。</li>\n<li><strong>運動安全與續航</strong>：支援 Pacer、心率區間及由 iPhone 上 Apple Intelligence 驅動的 Workout Buddy；具跌倒與嚴重車禍偵測，一般使用續航約 24 小時，快速充電 15 分鐘可用約 12 小時。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0HJB63G4M?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<img alt=\"Apple Watch Series 12 GPS 42mm Smartwatch | Dark Bronze Aluminum Case, Olive Sport Band - S/M. Health + Fitness + Sleep Tracking, Heart Rate, Safety\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31rpFO46CeL._SL500_.jpg\"/>\n</a>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0HJB63G4M?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Apple Watch Series 12 GPS 42mm Smartwatch | Dark Bronze Aluminum Case, Olive Sport Band - S/M. Health + Fitness + Sleep Tracking, Heart Rate, Safety</a>\n<p>\n<p>\n<p>\n<p>$299.00</p>\n<p>$399.00</p>\n<p>-25%</p>\n</p>\n<p>In Stock</p>\n</p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0HJB63G4M?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">立即購買</a>\n</p>\n</p>\n</p>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0HJBCGY95?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<img alt=\"Apple Watch Series 12 GPS 46mm Smartwatch | Black Aluminum Case, Black Sport Band - M/L. Health + Fitness + Sleep Tracking, Heart Rate, Safety\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31TDCgQg33L._SL500_.jpg\"/>\n</a>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0HJBCGY95?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Apple Watch Series 12 GPS 46mm Smartwatch | Black Aluminum Case, Black Sport Band - M/L. Health + Fitness + Sleep Tracking, Heart Rate, Safety</a>\n<p>\n<p>\n<p>\n<p>$349.00</p>\n<p>$449.00</p>\n<p>-22%</p>\n</p>\n<p>In Stock</p>\n</p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0HJBCGY95?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">立即購買</a>\n</p>\n</p>\n</p>\n<h2>為什麼會顯示沒有貨？</h2>\n<p>如果大家的 Amazon 帳號設定了本地地址，這樣當顯示美國限定產品時是會顯示「沒有供應」，然而大家只要輸入一些<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/2019/05/06/buy-and-ship/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">集運公司的地址</a>，這樣就可以正常顯示價格及送貨。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"Amazon 美國送貨地址設定\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"868\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/amazon-us-address.jpg\" width=\"1630\"/></figure>\n<h2>購買美版的 AppleCare 保修問題</h2>\n<p>不少人也對海外購買 Apple 產品的保修有疑問，其實 Apple 產品很多時也是全球性維修，不過 AppleCare+ 的意外換機則必須要原來的購買地才可。那就是你不能買美國版 AppleCare+ 在香港／台灣要求意外更換，必須要在美國更換。不過，維修一般沒有問題，當然每個地區的 Apple Store 也有其不同的。</p>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T14:15:30.144856+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1107,"images":4,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T14:04:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T15:37:40.651574+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T14:09:00.687013+00:00","content_hash":"e1c0743777f7bbe16fe5ef34732ed775f63e5cf2665f9e99a5e7bcd77701f66f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}